WEBVTT

00:01:30.900 --> 00:01:32.360
Then I'm off!

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:34.020
Be careful.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:35.600
Where are you going?

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:38.800
Elementary school. 
Today's a school day.

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.530
Then I'm going, too.

00:01:40.730 --> 00:01:41.500
Huh?!

00:01:41.680 --> 00:01:45.930
Eiko said that I "have to 
start in elementary school."

00:01:45.930 --> 00:01:49.040
I did say that, but that's 
not quite what I meant.

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:52.920
I don't mind, but there are a 
lot of elementary schoolers there.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:57.640
That's fine. 
I'm used to dealing with squiddle kids!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.230
I won't let them degrade me 
to a mere toy squid anymore!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:06.930
<b> Shall We Swim To An Elementary School?!</b>

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.010
The number of children here is

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.920
on a totally different level 
than at the Lemon.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.650
I want to squidaddle already.

00:02:17.010 --> 00:02:20.280
Hi, everybody!
 How have you all been?

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:23.580
I really missed you... guys...

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:28.000
They used to idolize me,

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.000
and now they completely ignore me.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:32.630
Who the hell does that little 
cat-burglar think she is?!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.760
Excuse me! Who do you think you are?

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.210
Outsiders can't just come in here, you know!

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:39.050
I swim in the same school as Takeru.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.370
Yeah!

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.640
Don't be mean to Squid Girlie!

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:46.130
I'm not feeling so well, 
so please do some self studying.

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.860
We're done already?

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:49.940
Oh yeah, Squid Girlie,

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:52.240
why don't you teach us something?

00:02:52.240 --> 00:02:53.080
What?

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:56.200
Wait, this might be my chance.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.110
I can convince the kids 
to become my allies!

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:02.740
Everybody, listen up!

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.660
Humans have polluted the ocean

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:07.950
time and time again for 
their own personal gain!

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:10.910
That's despite having enjoyed 
the gifts of the ocean.

00:03:11.240 --> 00:03:12.980
Don't you think it's horrible

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.730
to repay that by hurting the ocean?!

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:15.890
That's horrible.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:16.960
Yeah, that's totally horrible!

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:20.190
Let's defeat the evil humans who pollute the ocean

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:22.720
and get our clean ocean back!

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.890
Yeah!

00:03:24.220 --> 00:03:25.910
She really has what it takes

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:27.470
Okay, follow me!

00:03:25.910 --> 00:03:28.290
to gather children under her banner.

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:28.770
Yeah!

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:33.430
Let's defeat the littering humans!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:37.270
Let's get our clean ocean back!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.890
Let's defeat the littering humans!

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.370
See, this is what happens when I get serious.

00:03:40.890 --> 00:03:44.320
Let's get our clean ocean back!

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:44.320
I'm going to take over the 
entire elementary school like this.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.780
Out of the way!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.910
What the squid?!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.330
You're in the way of our march!

00:03:49.890 --> 00:03:51.470
No, you're in our way!

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:53.460
We were playing soccer here first!

00:03:55.020 --> 00:03:58.550
Those guys are always like that.
They always hog this place.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:01.530
Then how about we have a match 
of that soccer you speak of.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:02.390
What?!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:04.830
Oh? Sure, let's do it.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:06.670
W-wait Squid Girlie!

00:04:06.670 --> 00:04:08.430
Are you sure that's a good idea?

00:04:08.890 --> 00:04:10.510
There's nothing to worry about.

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:12.060
I'm going to win no matter what.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:16.290
It's always like this, but where 
does her confidence come from?

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:18.400
So, how does this soccer work?

00:04:19.390 --> 00:04:21.400
I knew you didn't know anything.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:26.080
Nice shot!

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:28.940
You kick the ball with 
your foot like that

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:30.770
and have to get it into 
the opponent's goal.

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.540
That's easier than baseball.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.310
Here you go, Squid Girlie.

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:37.010
Try passing that to me.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.310
All right.

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.810
I guess you're basically

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.260
really clumsy with anything 
but your tentacles.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.120
I'm going home.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.690
It's too early to leave!

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:51.640
Yeah, let's defeat them and show them!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:53.810
Oh, that's right!

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.150
I can't run away if I want 
to take over this school!

00:04:59.890 --> 00:05:01.540
Just you watch!

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.560
I'll show you how good I am!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.150
I did it!

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:16.240
Did you see my super shot?!

00:05:16.240 --> 00:05:17.660
That was handling!

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:20.880
Yeah! You totally used your hands!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:22.000
That goal doesn't count!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.970
What?! That wasn't my hands!

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.120
It was my tentacles!

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:27.590
<b>Tentacles</b>

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:26.520
My... tentacles...

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.590
<b><i>Hand</i></b>

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:32.040
Squid Girlie, even I don't 
think that will fly.

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.180
You really just threw it.

00:05:35.470 --> 00:05:37.140
It's squidding fine!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:41.020
I can score an amazing goal even 
without using my tentacles!

00:05:42.410 --> 00:05:44.160
Just leave the shots to me!

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:45.410
You heard that?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:46.950
Send all the balls to her!

00:05:47.620 --> 00:05:48.450
Squid Girlie!

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:50.660
Here!

00:05:51.860 --> 00:05:52.620
Again!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:59.190
This sport is pretty rough.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:02.130
Sorry, please go be the goal keeper.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:05.880
I see, the keeper is allowed 
to use their hands, huh.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.590
Somebody stop him!

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.570
Bring it on!

00:06:09.570 --> 00:06:12.390
What? How's that ever 
supposed to go in?!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:18.340
Do you know how dangerous 
it is to kick it that hard?!

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:20.740
But that's kind of the point...

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:21.270
Yeah.

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:23.490
Let's just go back to 
how we were before.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.590
All you need to do is kick

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:27.330
the ball when it comes to you.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:30.570
If I don't do something great 
before this ends,

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:33.950
everything I built up will be lost.

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:35.770
That girl's kind of gotten

00:06:35.770 --> 00:06:39.610
totally useless since she 
stopped using her weird hair.

00:06:39.610 --> 00:06:41.550
Were we a little too mean?

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.690
She has a lot of supporters, too.

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:48.510
If we win like this, won't we 
be made out to be total jerks?

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:53.050
Um, we have a favor to ask...

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:54.350
Don't worry!

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.620
You can do it!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:56.640
Go, go!

00:06:56.640 --> 00:06:59.840
They're all counting on me.

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.800
In order to keep my dignity as a squid,

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:04.570
I have to score, no matter what!

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:09.490
Squid Girlie, here!

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:11.600
All right!

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:12.780
This is it!

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.730
You scored a goal

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:24.900
while doing a backflip during 
your first match ever?!

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.220
I knew you were amazing!

00:07:28.070 --> 00:07:30.050
Isn't that normal?

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:32.550
It's customer soccer...

00:07:34.580 --> 00:07:35.840
A draw...

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:37.720
I guess we couldn't settle it.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.560
Don't say that.

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:43.020
Why don't you just share this field 
as friends from now on?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:48.230
I-I guess we can do 
what you suggested.

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.950
The kids from Class 3 listened to her.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.700
Squid Girlie is amazing.

00:07:53.390 --> 00:07:55.130
This feels so good.

00:07:55.130 --> 00:07:58.700
I think I am just a step away from 
taking over this elementary school.

00:07:58.700 --> 00:07:59.660
Hold it!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:00.930
Teacher!

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:02.790
I'd like my students back.

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.000
It's way too late!

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.470
Look at these numbers!

00:08:07.470 --> 00:08:09.920
All of them are already 
under my squidly control!

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:14.680
Our bond is not so fickle 
that it will crumble easily!

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:17.390
Let's see about that.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.100
Who wants ice cream?

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.150
Me!

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:22.520
What?!

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.730
<b>Bond</b>

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:27.270
<b>Bond</b>

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:31.010
The way of a squid-vader sure is rocky.

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:34.360
Lemon

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:35.480
Water!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:36.610
Two fried rice!

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:37.480
Beer!

00:08:37.480 --> 00:08:38.280
Ramen!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.950
Right away!

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:42.900
We don't really get a lot 
of female customers, huh?

00:08:42.900 --> 00:08:44.820
Now that you mention it...

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:46.070
I wonder why that is.

00:08:46.070 --> 00:08:49.440
I think they'd come if we 
had a handsome guy here.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.840
Where do you propose we find one?

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.550
Please stop that.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:55.760
Ink ya!

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:04.980
<b>Squid In Cosplay?!</b>

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.860
This the place that's said to have the hot waiter.

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.570
Welcome.

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.440
I'd like an iced tea, please.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:15.110
A parfait for me, please.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:17.540
Definitely a hit with the girls.

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.370
Mr. Nagisa is a success.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:21.410
Is this all right?

00:09:21.410 --> 00:09:22.740
Perfect.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:25.000
You completely look like a guy.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:27.450
R-really?

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.030
Well, sometimes people mistake me for a guy

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:32.870
even when I'm not disguised as one.

00:09:32.870 --> 00:09:37.500
No, I meant that you're really 
rocking the disguise.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.760
Oh, then I'm glad.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.720
Praising someone can be tricky.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.410
Excuse me.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:44.980
Right away.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:48.310
No matter how cool she acts, 
Nagisa is Nagisa.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:51.820
I'll scare her and show them 
her true colors!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.260
I'll take your order now.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.030
Nagisa.

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.910
Don't get too cocky,

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.410
or you're going to 
face the consequences.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:01.570
So scared...

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:06.090
But... No. Right now I'm 
the cool dude, Mr. Nagisa.

00:10:06.090 --> 00:10:08.170
I have to display a 
manly reaction to this.

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:14.250
Miss, I'm sorry but I 
have to work right now.

00:10:14.250 --> 00:10:16.950
The weather's nice, so why 
don't you go play outside?

00:10:18.480 --> 00:10:20.810
My squid-vasion is no game!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:23.730
Look at that:
 the roles are reversed.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:26.210
Welcome!

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:29.100
Ahh! Nagisa!

00:10:29.450 --> 00:10:31.430
Mr. Nagisa, please take this.

00:10:31.430 --> 00:10:31.810
Sure.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:35.530
I can't deal with the Nagisa 
in that male outfit that well.

00:10:38.970 --> 00:10:40.920
This disguise might be pretty handy.

00:10:43.470 --> 00:10:45.670
Seeing this makes me kind of greedy.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.020
It would be nice to attract more 
male customers too, huh?

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:49.460
Hey.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:51.470
Oh, you're from the South Wind.

00:10:51.780 --> 00:10:53.900
Looks like you're quite busy here.

00:10:53.900 --> 00:10:56.260
If you want to borrow me again, no way.

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.720
That's not it.

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:01.640
I actually wanted you to 
take in my Ayumi again.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:02.430
Ayumi?

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:06.100
So your name was Ayumi, huh?

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:13.330
I figured she'd be less shy 
here where she isn't known.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.970
I guess that makes sense.

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:17.160
All right then, she's all yours.

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:19.030
That's putting way too much on our hands!

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.890
Oh, that's fine.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.280
I couldn't ask for anyone 
better than Ayumi.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:24.750
I guess you're right.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:27.240
There's no way the guys can stay away.

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:29.340
What will she wear though?

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:32.940
It needs to make an impact, 
or she'll lose out to male Nagisa.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:37.220
It's perfect!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.090
That looks great on you.

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.280
I'm embarrassed...

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:45.390
If only there was something to 
cover up your shy side a bit.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:47.890
How about this?

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:50.470
I bought it for self-defense.

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.690
As if you need something like that...

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.440
There's been a lot of 
girls here lately.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.900
Isozaki. Did he come 
here to hit on girls?

00:12:00.840 --> 00:12:03.510
They are here! A whole smorgasboard of girls!

00:12:04.040 --> 00:12:07.120
Welcome home, master.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:08.830
This girl...

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:13.100
Nice to see you again.

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.100
How about a date when 
your shift is over?

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:17.570
A movie or karaoke?

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.800
This <i>is</i> scary,

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.130
but I can't flinch now.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.020
So how can I reach you?

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:25.720
M-master...

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:28.200
Can I take your order?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:33.270
I-iced coffee...

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.300
Understood.

00:12:37.650 --> 00:12:39.320
Why... I don't even...

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.490
You managed to speak proactively.

00:12:42.120 --> 00:12:43.570
Thanks to this.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.840
Please keep it up then.

00:12:45.840 --> 00:12:47.660
Oh, welcome.

00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:48.410
Welco-

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:52.040
Welcome home, master.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.290
S-sure?

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:54.540
Welco-

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:56.670
Please take the seats in the back!

00:12:57.930 --> 00:12:59.800
Here is your beer.

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.880
T-thank you.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.460
It's true.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:06.090
I can speak on equal terms with the customers.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:07.550
Excuse me.

00:13:07.550 --> 00:13:08.260
Right away!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.250
I'll go.

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.520
Excuse me.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.600
Right away!

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.710
What can I do for you?

00:13:14.710 --> 00:13:16.910
Could I please get an orange juice?

00:13:16.910 --> 00:13:19.110
How did it come to this?

00:13:19.540 --> 00:13:21.940
Nagisa isn't scared at all.

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:24.320
And Ayumi's confident now...

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:28.780
At this rate, those two are 
going to invade my home base!

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.380
I want to do something, too!

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:32.840
What are you talking about?

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.210
You're cosplaying as a squid.

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:37.220
This isn't cosplay!

00:13:37.220 --> 00:13:38.260
Thanks.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:40.460
Thank you for coming.

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.960
Fine, I'll squidding think of something myself!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.510
Hey, how's my Ayumi doing?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.270
Did she get used to the customers a bit?

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:48.640
Yeah, she's totally fine.

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.810
Yes, understood, master.

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:56.110
You fool!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:59.510
This is no different than 
the fake Squid Girl costume!

00:13:59.510 --> 00:14:01.270
Ayumi, we're going home!

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.620
I'm the same.

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:06.730
I can only remain strong 
against that squid person

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:08.480
because I'm disguised as a man.

00:14:08.480 --> 00:14:12.030
I'm just avoiding the issue 
and not changing my core self.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:16.290
Isn't there something I can do?

00:14:21.220 --> 00:14:22.420
This is it!

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.230
Good morning.

00:14:24.230 --> 00:14:25.800
Huh, Nagisa?

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.120
I won't wear the male disguise anymore.

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.720
That's what I decided.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:31.460
That's fine.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:34.270
That's something we 
pushed on you anyway.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:38.060
I'm sorry, we'll have 
fewer female customers.

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.150
I'm here!

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.360
What are you doing?

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.990
I'm Queen Esquidzabeth.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:47.860
I am going to bring more 
customers here than ever.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:49.910
What? We're done with the cosplaying.

00:14:50.580 --> 00:14:52.890
Squidservants! We're going!

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.620
Aye, milady!

00:15:00.930 --> 00:15:05.550
My squidizens! I thank you 
for gathering for me.

00:15:07.350 --> 00:15:09.430
What are you just standing around for?

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:11.510
That's where you go "yay!"

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:13.470
Yaaay!

00:15:15.920 --> 00:15:18.270
My Queen, please speak to us.

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:21.270
I'm going to change.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:30.960
This is the hottest day ever.

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:33.370
The heat is warping the air.

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:35.250
Make sure to drink plenty of fluids

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.610
so you don't get heat stroke.

00:15:37.890 --> 00:15:38.830
Okay!

00:15:39.010 --> 00:15:40.850
I'm going to have an orange juice-

00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.230
That hurt!

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:45.570
Those are for sale!

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.710
Drink water.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:48.010
Here.

00:15:49.370 --> 00:15:51.760
You could've just squidding said 
so in the first place.

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.930
Wa... wa...

00:15:55.420 --> 00:15:57.270
Wa... wa...

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:00.060
wa... water.

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:01.730
Who are you?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:06.730
Squidn't You Lose A Little Weight?!

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:09.120
Here.

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.170
I've got a new lease on life!

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:17.350
Oh, it's you, Sanae.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.110
I thought you were some boxer 
trying to lose weight!

00:16:20.110 --> 00:16:21.430
What were you thinking,

00:16:21.430 --> 00:16:23.500
going outside dressed like that 
on a hot day like this?

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:24.580
It's suicide!

00:16:24.980 --> 00:16:27.140
I thought that it'd be faster this way.

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:30.840
Yeah, but doesn't it defeat the purpose, 
if it makes you sick?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.630
Wow, you're actually worried about me!

00:16:33.980 --> 00:16:35.980
I'm so happy!

00:16:35.980 --> 00:16:37.350
Get off me!

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:42.100
But you don't even look fat at all.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.430
Well you see...

00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:46.960
Lately, I've gotten into this 
habit of putting Squiddie's

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:48.730
picture on my table when I eat and

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:51.240
looking at it really 
works up an appetite.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.450
I'm not some side dish!

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.320
What exactly... are you trying to do?

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.490
I'm just saying, if you're not careful,

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:01.270
you'll be gaining weight before you know it.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.310
Have you weighed yourself lately?

00:17:03.310 --> 00:17:04.310
Nope.

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:06.420
With my body type, I can 
eat and eat and not gain any...

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:10.140
What was that for?!

00:17:10.140 --> 00:17:13.010
It hurt me more...

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:17.260
You don't look like you need to diet, Squiddie.

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:21.020
You guys keep talking about 
diets and dieting,

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.770
but what the squid does that even mean?

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:24.210
Losing weight is...

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:26.230
...the perennial concern of women!

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:28.110
That is what dieting is!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.600
What she's trying to 
say is that no matter

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.290
how much she wants to 
lose weight, she can't.

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:34.360
I guess it must be like 
invading is for me.

00:17:35.410 --> 00:17:37.820
Let us both do our best 
together, Squiddie!

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:38.880
Get off of me!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.590
Squiddie looks really skinny,
 but she's actually pretty strong, huh?

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:47.790
Yeah, I guess so.

00:17:48.270 --> 00:17:50.880
You're actually pretty 
heavy, aren't you?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.510
I think I'm an average squid.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:54.050
How many kilos is average?

00:17:54.050 --> 00:17:55.050
Why don't we weigh her?

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.170
Huh?

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.640
No way!

00:17:59.900 --> 00:18:02.680
It says she's 100 kilos.

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:07.170
But where is she carrying all that?

00:18:08.570 --> 00:18:10.950
That scale's broken you know.

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:13.660
I just used it and it gave 
me an unbelievable reading.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:16.040
Oh, okay.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:19.710
Even if it's broken, 100 
kilos is pretty extreme.

00:18:20.350 --> 00:18:22.330
Just how messed up is this thing?

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.450
Well, that's strange.

00:18:27.610 --> 00:18:28.920
Sis...?

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:31.040
I told you it's broken!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.180
I'm sorry for shouting.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:40.590
She just didn't want to admit 
that she's gotten heavier.

00:18:40.980 --> 00:18:44.310
Why did she get so squidding mad about it?

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:49.100
So I guess it wasn't broken after all.

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.350
There's no reason to worry.

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.750
Even a girl as skinny as 
Squid Girl is 100 kilos!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.480
Really?

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.060
Squid Girl?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.260
What is it?

00:19:11.260 --> 00:19:13.250
Why don't you weigh yourself again?

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.310
Since that other scale was broken?

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:17.300
All right.

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.720
30 kilos?

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:22.970
It went down!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:26.040
But she was 100 kilos the 
last time we weighed her.

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:28.780
Could this be broken too?

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.670
Didn't you just buy it?

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:37.400
By the way, how did you manage 
to lose 70 kilos so quickly?

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.530
I can change my weight 
around as necessary.

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.570
How?

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:46.660
100 kilos!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:48.260
It went up again!

00:19:48.640 --> 00:19:50.550
What's 100 kilos?

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:52.670
No way!

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:56.050
You did something before you 
got on the scale, didn't you?

00:19:56.590 --> 00:19:59.700
I guess I haven't told you yet.

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.410
I can change my weight

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:03.550
by adjusting this bracelet.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:05.680
Really?

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:08.560
I thought that bracelet did something

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:10.260
a lot more important,
 since you never take it off.

00:20:11.170 --> 00:20:14.430
This is very important 
for using my tentacles!

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:15.480
For your tentacles?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:22.800
<b>Light</b>

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:17.230
If my body is too light,

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.180
it will move around when I try 
to pick up something heavy

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:22.440
or make strong movements.

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.310
When I'm outside,

00:20:22.800 --> 00:20:28.080
<b>Heavy</b>

00:20:24.310 --> 00:20:26.140
I usually make myself 
somewhat heavier so

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:28.080
I can always use my tentacles.

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:32.090
If you can make your body 
lighter than normal,

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.420
what happens if you try to make 
your body as light as possible?

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.040
You want me to make myself 
as light as possible?

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:42.520
You're lighter now?

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:43.240
Yup.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:44.970
You can't even tell.

00:20:48.100 --> 00:20:50.140
You can get that light?

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:53.160
That's quite a power.

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:56.560
Someone that light could even fly!

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:59.610
You really want to do this, Squid Girl?

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.480
Land, sea, and air.

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:04.320
A true invader conquers them all.

00:21:04.710 --> 00:21:07.990
And I'm capable of that!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.460
That's amazing!

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.230
I'm going to take over the sky!

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:23.840
A black kite got her!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:26.350
Squid Girlie!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:30.260
Help me!

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:36.270
I thought I was bird food.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:39.080
Are you okay?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:40.250
Land, sea, and air, huh?

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.320
Looks like you fail on all three.

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:44.400
I am a little interested in that bracelet, though.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.770
I can't let you have it!

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:48.580
I just want to look 
at it for a tiny bit!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:49.660
No!

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:51.620
Just for a second!

00:23:41.710 --> 00:23:44.760
A notice from Lemon House 
By The Sea's Eiko Aizawa:

00:23:44.760 --> 00:23:45.730
The next episodes will be:

00:23:45.730 --> 00:23:47.160
How About A Squiddle Walk?!

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:48.490
Time To Squidzercise?!

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.650
Wanna Lend A Helping Tentacle?!

00:23:50.770 --> 00:23:53.540
Come visit us sometime! You won't regret it!
